The reflector `reflector` (queen bee shuttle, block, eater) under the eight symmetries of the
square, each with its input glider at phase `0` and its output `30` generations later: the corner
pieces of every route of the layout of report `R-31` (research note `N-19`). Generated by
`scripts/life_cert/rf_images.py` (untrusted); every certificate is checked here.
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false

@[expose] public section

